"\n<header class=\"plan-intro card\"><div class=\"topline\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">5 people · 5 sprints · one integrated product</div><h2>Reduced team project roadmap</h2><p class=\"subtitle\">Student Performance — Course MVP<br>Reduced revision 3.1 · five two-week sprints · small application, complete course evidence</p></div><div class=\"header-actions\"><button id=\"exportText\">Download all cards</button><button id=\"exportProgress\" class=\"button primary\">Export progress</button><button id=\"importProgress\">Restore progress</button><input type=\"file\" id=\"restoreFile\" accept=\"application/json,.json\" hidden></div><a class=\"button\" href=\"/student-performance-plan-reduced.html\" download>Reduced source plan</a></div><div class=\"legend\" id=\"legend\"></div></header>\n<nav class=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"Roadmap sections\" id=\"nav\"></nav>\n<div class=\"notice\">Reduced MVP: 26 Must delivery cards, 8 optional feature cards, 35 course-record cards and 11 explicit Won’t decisions. Four Could ideas remain unscheduled. Local demonstration is the planning assumption; professor confirmation and the skills check remain pending.</div>\n<div id=\"storage-notice\" class=\"notice\" role=\"status\"></div>\n<div class=\"stats\" id=\"stats\"></div>\n<div class=\"toolbar\" id=\"toolbar\"><label class=\"field\">Find a task<div class=\"searchrow\"><input id=\"search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Card ID, concept or title…\"><button id=\"clearSearch\" aria-label=\"Clear task search\" hidden>Clear</button></div></label><label class=\"field\">Member<select id=\"ownerFilter\"><option value=\"all\">All five members</option></select></label><label class=\"field\">Sprint<select id=\"sprintFilter\"><option value=\"all\">All sprints</option><option value=\"1\">Sprint 1</option><option value=\"2\">Sprint 2</option><option value=\"3\">Sprint 3</option><option value=\"4\">Sprint 4</option><option value=\"5\">Sprint 5</option><option value=\"0\">Unscheduled</option></select></label><label class=\"field\">Priority<select id=\"priorityFilter\"><option value=\"all\">All priorities</option><option>Must</option><option>Should</option><option>Could</option><option>Won’t</option></select></label><label class=\"field\">Work type<select id=\"kindFilter\"><option value=\"all\">All tasks</option><option selected>Delivery</option><option>Scrum</option><option>Deferred</option></select></label><label class=\"field\">Scope<select id=\"scopeFilter\"><option value=\"all\">All forecast</option><option value=\"core\">Must only</option><option value=\"selected\">Core + selected stretch</option><option value=\"stretch\">Unselected stretch</option><option value=\"excluded\">Won’t decisions</option></select></label><button id=\"readyFilter\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Ready to start</button><div class=\"counter\" id=\"resultCount\"></div></div>\n<div id=\"status\" class=\"statusline\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n<div id=\"content\"></div>\n<footer>Local progress stays in this browser where storage is available. Export a backup for portability. Checklist ticks are planning aids; Done still requires actual artifacts and independent review. The editable planning kit contains five team backlogs and 25 individual-summary templates.</footer>\n"
